#: main.cpp:111
msgid "<h1>Enhanced Browsing</h1> In this module you can configure some enhanced browsing features of KDE. <h2>Internet Keywords</h2>Internet Keywords let you type in the name of a brand, a project, a celebrity, etc... and go to the relevant location. For example you can just type \"KDE\" or \"K Desktop Environment\" in Konqueror to go to KDE's homepage.<h2>Web Shortcuts</h2>Web Shortcuts are a quick way of using Web search engines. For example, type \"altavista:frobozz\" or \"av:frobozz\" and Konqueror will do a search on AltaVista for \"frobozz\". Even easier: just press Alt+F2 (if you haven't changed this shortcut) and enter the shortcut in the KDE Run Command dialog."
msgstr "<h1>Pelungsuran Ekstra</h1> Di dalam modul ini anda boleh menyelaraskan ciri-ciri lungsuran KDE. <h2>Kata Kunci Internet</h2>Kata Kunci Internet membolehkan anda menaip jenama, projek, selebriti, dan lain-lain .....dan dibawa ke lokasi berkaitan. Sebagai contoh anda boleh taip \"KDE\" atau \"K Desktop Environment\" di dalam Konqueror untuk ke laman web KDE.<h2>Pintasan Web</h2>Pintasan Web adalah cara yang cepat untuk menggunakan enjin carian Web. Contohnya taip \"altavista:frobozz\" atau \"av:frobozz\" dan Konqueror akan memulakan carian di  AltaVista untuk \"frobozz\". Malah untuk lebih mudah lagi, tekan Alt+F2 (jika anda tidak mengubah pintasan ini) dan masukkaan pintasan di dialog larikan arahan KDE ."

#: plugins/ikws/ikwsopts.cpp:91
msgid "In this module you can configure the web shortcuts feature. Web shortcuts allow you to quickly search or lookup words on the Internet. For example, to search for information about the KDE project using the Google engine, you simply type <b>gg:KDE</b> or <b>google:KDE</b>.<p>If you select a default search engine, normal words or phrases will be looked up at the specified search engine by simply typing them into applications, such as Konqueror, that have built-in support for such a feature."
msgstr ""

